{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover \u00c6THER RUSH \u2013 The first game in the AFTERLIFE franchise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00c6THER RUSH is a semi-open exploration-adventure game with delivery mechanics, set in the AFTERLIFE universe. You play as an independent courier in Lumina, a vertical cyberpunk city where ASTRAEN and DOVAREN clash for control of \u00c6ther. As a direct prequel to AFTERLIFE, this game is a key technical and narrative pillar of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mercenary courier, you must navigate the suspended heights of Lumina\u2014floating platforms, aerial docks, and crowded corridors. Every \u00c6ther delivery is a challenge: prepare your vehicle, optimize routes, dodge surveillance drones, and manage an unstable resource. Your alliances shape your reputation and opportunities: work for ASTRAEN, side with the DOVAREN, or remain neutral to thrive in the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and customize modules to complete missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain reputation and rewards with ASTRAEN or DOVAREN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore platforms, aerial corridors, and corrupted zones of Lumina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade engines, armor, and tools to deliver faster and farther.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004670?t=1767368701","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004670/aac24876cc5a2cbe927c4cd272010c0ab6be2569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767368701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004670/3a8db36a6ee6a00bb5451e7bcc5e811717abe213/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767368701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004670/3a8db36a6ee6a00bb5451e7bcc5e811717abe213/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767368701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover \u00c6THER RUSH \u2013 The first game in the AFTERLIFE franchise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00c6THER RUSH is a semi-open exploration-adventure game with delivery mechanics, set in the AFTERLIFE universe. You play as an independent courier in Lumina, a vertical cyberpunk city where ASTRAEN and DOVAREN clash for control of \u00c6ther. As a direct prequel to AFTERLIFE, this game is a key technical and narrative pillar of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mercenary courier, you must navigate the suspended heights of Lumina\u2014floating platforms, aerial docks, and crowded corridors. Every \u00c6ther delivery is a challenge: prepare your vehicle, optimize routes, dodge surveillance drones, and manage an unstable resource. Your alliances shape your reputation and opportunities: work for ASTRAEN, side with the DOVAREN, or remain neutral to thrive in the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and customize modules to complete missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain reputation and rewards with ASTRAEN or DOVAREN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore platforms, aerial corridors, and corrupted zones of Lumina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade engines, armor, and tools to deliver faster and farther.</p></li></ul>","developers":["HAPAX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description